    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Assimilation Swarm",
    "summary": "During [your Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase), every **HARVESTER** unit of yours can Regenerate a **TYRANIDS** unit of yours up to 6\" from it. No unit can be regenerated more than once per phase. Whenever a unit regenerates, pick one of these:\n\n- a model in the unit gets back as many as D3+1 lost wounds\n- a **destroyed** **INFANTRY** model, other than a **CHARACTERS** model, returns to the unit at full wounds; for an **ENDLESS MULTITUDE** unit, as many as 3 **destroyed** models return instead",
